      "completedAt": "2026-09-11T14:30:09.000Z",
      "conclusion": "Live PostgreSQL 16.15 comparison run. PostgreSQL resolves a CTE-shadowed name to the CTE, confirming DF-STRATA-2026-9B2E against the real engine; it refuses ambiguous columns and folds unquoted identifiers, both matching Strata's model. Demonstrated RK-003: the 17.5 parser accepts JSON_TABLE and MERGE...RETURNING which the 16.15 server rejects, so a statement can be reported as parsed while being unexecutable. Recorded as a gap for the S4 validation slice. Overload resolution and Q-027 remain untested."
    },
